{"title":"Glimmerfox","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 41 Moonbeast that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 9 times (0.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonhart-antler\">Moonhart Antler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/lycan-claw\">Lycan Claw</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>2,150</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=39\">Lv 39 <span>17</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>33</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>2,107</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>2,013</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>183</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>152</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>191</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>112</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>72</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>0</b></td><td>12</td><td>1.5</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 2.1 · 150</td><td>2,150</td><td>in the wilds around 1685, 1783</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=39\" title=\"Pick level 39\"><td><b>39</b></td><td>185</td><td>26</td><td>1,950</td><td class=\"muted\">555 · 36.4 · 5,850</td><td>17</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><b>40</b></td><td>194</td><td>26.5</td><td>2,000</td><td class=\"muted\">582 · 37.1 · 6,000</td><td>33</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=41\" title=\"Pick level 41\"><td><b>41</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>2,107</td><td>in the wilds around 1945, 1656</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>2,013</td><td>in the wilds around 1953, 1661</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>183</td><td>in the wilds around 1942, 1559</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/glimmerfox?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>